{"event_id":"evt_8abb00d89059","run_id":"rep_ad4b1bed1193","seq":41,"occurred_at":"2026-11-26T12:43:35.960734+00:00","type":"evidence.reviewed","actor_id":"persona_validation","target_ids":["persona_analysis","persona_validation"],"subject":{"kind":"evidence","id":"evid_265e1d8ed6"},"status":"passed","summary":"Evidence Gate verdict: PASSED (S1 verified).","payload":{"claim_id":"claim_team_size_disruption","result":"passed","reproduction_level":"S1","checks":{"manifest_complete":true,"dataset_sha256_verified":true,"script_executed_cleanly":true,"reproduction_level_honest":true,"table_and_sample_n_consistent":true,"figures_valid_png":true,"s2_toy_graph_verified":true},"research_gains":{"verified_insights":["Across N=45,335 MAG papers (1954-2014), mean disruption declines from 0.0140 (percentile 54.3) for solo authors to 0.0004 (percentile 41.2) for 11+ teams (OLS slope -0.00187/author, p=6.89e-40), while mean citations rise from 24.0 to 68.1.","Within-field demeaning across 19 MAG Level-0 disciplines preserves the negative team-size vs. disruption gradient."],"ruled_out_explanations":["Ruled out composition across disciplines as the sole driver: field-demeaned disruption remains positive for solo authors and negative for large teams.","Ruled out post-2014 right-truncation as creating the historical negative slope: restricting strictly to 1954-2004 (>=17y forward window) retains the monotonic decline."],"open_questions":["Cross-corpus generalization to USPTO patents and GitHub software repositories from Nature 2019 was not re-run in this MAG/OpenAlex slice.","Recent counter-arguments (e.g., citation inflation & reference-list length biases in 2024-2026 preprints) warrant controlled reference-count normalization in S3."],"methodology_lessons":["Dataverse Aggregated_20210521.txt contains 6 columns (no Multi-Institution flag despite dataset prose abstract); empirical schema inspection prevented silent column-shift bugs.","Comparing 1954-2004 vs. 2015-2021 regimes shows forward citation-window truncation compresses D-score variance, confirming that cohort year fixed effects or matched windows are mandatory."]}},"evidence_ids":["evid_265e1d8ed6"],"artifact_ids":["art_2060e7aa8c02","art_d1391b6fddff","art_373447f827c6","art_727d71933003","art_f3296f4b12c8","art_746d0dcc1326","art_d78b5c76c752"],"mode":"live","source":"validator"}
